    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1950, and you're Patricia Rotstein, the esteemed mystery novelist. Or well, you were, before your untimely death.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with the help of only your cat, Hexe, and some newfound ghostly abilities, you must investigate your own murder and mend the myriad problems your family members face before it's too late. You'll need to be ready for puzzles, possessions, and more.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1950, and you're Patricia Rotstein, the esteemed mystery novelist. Or well, you were, before your untimely death.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with the help of only your cat, Hexe, and some newfound ghostly abilities, you must investigate your own murder and mend the myriad problems your family members face before it's too late. You'll need to be ready for puzzles, possessions, and more.</p>",
    "short_description": "A first-person mystery game with puzzles and story-rich dialogue. Explore a 3D environment with original art, character design, and a distinct cartoon-y style. Investigate your own murder through branching conversations and a unique possession mechanic. Featuring original music by Svetlana Rudenko.",
